# Mechanic: Select two life payments and one black mana payment for K'rrik.
# Forcing: Available mana allows either method, so the player's choices determine life and tapped lands.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield leave no intervening decision.
# Failure modes: Missing choices or unchanged life indicate automatic payment rather than the selected method.
# Card roles: K'rrik supplies three phyrexian symbols. Seven Swamps can pay the entire cost. Libraries prevent draw losses.
# Protocol path: Cast, CastingTimeOptionsReq ManaType, selected payment, battlefield state.
